WEBVTT

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:03.280
na inatuzamisha kwenye umoja wa uwongo
kulinda hadhi iliopo.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:09.896
Tazama, kila mtu,
nimesema utamaduni wa uweupe,

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:11.976
na sio watu weupe.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.976
Kwa sababu kwenye makadirio yangu,

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.120
tatizo sio watu weupe.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:21.560
Badala yake, ni utamaduni wa uweupe.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.696
Na kwa utamaduni wa uweupe,

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:29.696
ninamaanisha mfumo na mpangilio
wa aina za imani,

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:36.200
thamani, maarifa yenye kanuni
na hata dini,